==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|velt}}, from {{inh|de|goh|feld}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*felþą}}, from {{inh|de|ine-pro|*pelh₂-}}. Cognates include {{cog|nl|veld}} and {{cog|en|field}}.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=Feld}}</ref> German {{m|de|Gefilde||fields}} is a collective derivation of ''Feld''.<ref>{{R:EWddS|ed=22|hw=Gefilde}}</ref>

